==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Arabic {{Arab|[[عيد الأضحى]]}} ''‘īd al-'aDHā''.

===Proper noun===
'''Eid al-Adha'''

# an [[Islamic]] [[festival]] commemorating the [[prophet]] [[Ibrahim]]'s willingness to [[sacrifice]] his son [[Ismail]] to [[Allah]]

====Alternative spellings====
* [['Eid ul-Adha]]
* [[Eid ul-Adha]]
* [['Eid al-Adha]]

